{"updated":"2026-11-11T02:22:38.411Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DfirwS_H9XK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfirwS_H9XK","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Anthropic 昨天正式推出 Claude Fable 5.2 與 Mythos 5.2，這次的能力真的有點誇張，已經不只是幫忙寫程式了\n 最讓我驚訝的是，Anthropic 公布了幾個實際測試案例： \n🔹 從零打造作業系統：協調超過 1,000 個 AI Agents，花 8 天打造出能在筆電啟動的 OS，包含核心、驅動程式、視窗與登入介面。 \n🔹 30 小時完成數學證明形式化：透過約 1,000 個 Agents，完成費馬最後定理的電腦可驗證證明形式化。 \n🔹 硬體設計也能做：從電路板、3D 外殼到韌體，一口氣設計出三款可正常運作的電子裝置。 🔹 程式能力大幅提升：FrontierCode 2.0 達到 49.1%，超越 Opus 5.5 的 45.5%。 \n🔹 資安能力升級：Mythos 5.2 在漏洞重新發現測試中達到 89.6%。 \n而且這兩款其實是相同的底層模型，主要差別在安全限制與開放對象。 API 定價為每百萬輸入 Tokens $8、輸出 $40，另有最高加速 2.5 倍的 Fast Mode。","timestamp":"2026-11-10T01:04:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfirwQfnzqT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfirwQfnzqT","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"我覺得最值得關注的不是 Benchmark，而是 AI 已經開始從「幫工程師完成單一任務」，進化成「自己規劃、協調多個 Agents，完成大型工程專案」。 \n未來軟體工程師的工作方式，可能真的會有很大的改變。\n官方介紹：\nanthropic.com/claud…\n#Claude #Anthropic #AIAgent #Coding #AI","timestamp":"2026-11-10T01:04:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DficH4jgOjX","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DficH4jgOjX","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"誰說個人網站只能是文章列表？直接把整座 3D 小島變成自己的部落格！🏝️\n\n🏝️ 3D 小島場景，自由探索海岸、建築與燈塔 \n🌊 程式生成海水、折射、水草與游動魚群 \n🌅 支援日夜變化、黃昏光影與海浪音效 \n🎣 內建釣魚小遊戲，還能升級釣具 \n📝 整合部落格文章、每日資訊與影片 \n🤖 使用 Claude、Codex 協助開發\n\n最酷的是，文章和內容不再只是冷冰冰的網頁，而是變成島上的一部分！\n\n而且整套網站程式碼採用 MIT 授權，可以改造成自己的 3D 個人網站或作品集。🔥\n#ThreeJS #Astro #OpenSource #WebDev #VibeCoding","timestamp":"2026-11-09T22:50:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DficcXpH7Ge","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DficcXpH7Ge","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🌐 線上體驗：\nxiaodao.ai\n🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/xiaow…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T22:50:38.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfia5CZnxfE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfia5CZnxfE","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"沒想到小小一塊 OLED 螢幕，也能做出這麼可愛的動畫效果！🤖\n\n這次分享我自己開發的開源專案：OLEDfx，一套專為 ESP32、Arduino 與微控制器打造的程式化動畫特效庫\n\n目前內建 100 種動畫、5 大類，不用自己一幀一幀畫\n\n👀 25 種機器人眼睛表情，眨眼、開心、生氣、愛心 \n🌦️ 18 種天氣動畫，下雨、下雪、雷暴與極光 \n📡 22 種系統動畫，Wi-Fi、電量、CPU 與藍牙 \n☕ 20 種桌面動畫，番茄鐘、咖啡、沙漏與植物 \n🎬 15 種轉場特效，像素溶解、CRT 與雷達掃描\n\n最酷的是，所有動畫都是透過程式計算生成，不依賴預先繪製的 Sprite Sheet\n\n還提供瀏覽器模擬器，不用先買硬體就能預覽效果。\n\n拿來做桌面小機器人、IoT 裝置、智慧時鐘或 ESP32 DIY 專案真的超適合\n#ESP32 #Arduino #OLED #OpenSource #IoT","timestamp":"2026-11-09T22:37:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfia5ycn3dj","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfia5ycn3dj","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🌐 線上體驗：\nmalilion.github.io/oledf…\n🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/malil…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T22:37:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfholIMEy_v","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfholIMEy_v","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"誰說網站 UI 一定要走極簡風？像素風介面真的越看越上癮！🎮\n\n而且不只支援 React，現在連 Vue、Angular 都能用了！🤯\n\n🎨 內建 111 種 UI 元件，按鈕、表單、彈窗、圖表通通有 \n🕹️ 超過 226 個像素風 SVG Icon，涵蓋 7 大主題 \n✨ 支援動態圖示、Hover 動畫與 3D 視差效果 \n🛠️ 提供視覺化 Icon Builder，自由設計像素圖示 \n📱 內建 6 種頁面模板，快速打造復古風網站 \n⚡ 支援 React、Vue 3、Angular 與 Tailwind CSS v4\n\n最酷的是，連通知訊息、互動元件都能維持一致的像素風格！\n\n拿來做個人作品集、遊戲官網、開發者工具或 RPG 風格 Dashboard，感覺超適合！🔥\n#OpenSource #GitHub #PixelArt #React #Vue","timestamp":"2026-11-09T15:17:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhomDLk1pq","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfhomDLk1pq","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"🌐 線上展示：\npxlkit.xyz\n🔗 GitHub：\ngithub.com/Joang…\n\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T15:17:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"Dfj9q00gqDv","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfj9q00gqDv","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原po辦公室有位同事他老婆懷孕第二胎\n懷第二個月男方就和其中一位女同事感情不錯\n半年後在一起了\n我會知道是因為這女同事很良心不安常在哭\n她跟我說的⋯我也不知道怎麼安慰她\n\n男方也不是第一次外遇\n前一個對象是上一間公司的\n聽說交往三四年\n所以我才在想 正宮真的都不知道嗎🤔️","timestamp":"2026-11-10T13:00:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":11,"replies":3,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":20,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T05:12:55+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfj9tUyAgvR","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfj9tUyAgvR","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨外遇真的另一半都不知道嗎✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多感情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-10T13:00:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T05:12:55+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfj38q2iCL8","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfj38q2iCL8","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"一堆火象星座一起上班be like：\n\n牡羊座上班就是 急急急急 快快快快\n常常櫃台才剛結帳完 \n後面調理的牡羊就做好飲料了 (神速啊\n\n獅子座上班也是效率\n差別在比較不是給人很急的感覺\n平時人都笑笑 甜甜的 超開朗\n但面對奧客真的就……處理的頗霸氣\n\n射手座則是會有自己的做事步驟\n算是滿聰明 總是事半功倍\n在同事間也很帶動快樂上班的氣氛","timestamp":"2026-11-10T12:10:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":155,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":12},"score":161,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfj3-eriHde","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfj3-eriHde","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨一堆火象星座一起上班✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多星座的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-10T12:10:28.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfjzdBCiFe2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfjzdBCiFe2","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有從小公司跳大公司的人嗎？\n\n現在原po在小公司(科技業)，但這份還未滿一年\n看朋友工作大約兩三年後到大公司\n感覺福利超好的，而且工作壓力不會太誇張\n他們也常鼓勵我累積工作能力，可以隔段時間投履歷看看\n\n小公司的優點，大概就是準時上下班、假日可以好好休息、職場關係單純...","timestamp":"2026-11-10T11:30:56.000Z","stats":{"likes":16,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfjze8KCMD2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfjze8KCMD2","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨有從小公司跳大公司的人嗎?現在怎麼樣?✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多心情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-10T11:31:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfjwA-mDjaA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfjwA-mDjaA","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨未婚妻叫我趕快處理痔瘡 爸媽卻一直勸我不要開刀✨搜尋文章標題，就能看更多心情的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-10T11:00:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfjwAQNjvrL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfjwAQNjvrL","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有人可以幫原po解惑嗎><？\n\n男生問這個有點尷尬\n但最近真的被痔瘡搞到很煩\n明年1月要結婚，最近工作跟婚禮兩邊一起忙\n每天幾乎都坐超過10小時，前陣子開始💩會出🩸\n本來想說男人這種東西忍忍就過了\n結果未婚妻知道之後一直叫我去看，她說之後還要出國蜜月\n不要到時候人在國外才嚴重發作\n但我爸媽知道反而一直說不要亂開刀，說痔瘡手術很痛\n能撐就撐多喝水，自己就會好了\n\n誰說的才是對的？","timestamp":"2026-11-10T11:00:48.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":13,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"DflM5zvk1dJ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DflM5zvk1dJ","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Steam Deck 的「已驗證」不等於你想要的流暢度！Valve 新增玩家平均 FPS 與幀率分布，可從商店頁面查詢。數據來自匿名玩家樣本，不是每台機器的效能保證；測試版收藏庫也能看。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-11T00:32:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T10:23:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DflM6Rbky7c","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DflM6Rbky7c","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-11T00:32:38.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T10:23:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfj7CYGFLdE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dfj7CYGFLdE","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"X 現在能直接剪出影片精華，不必先下載再用外部軟體處理，片段也會標註並連回原作者。不過，並非所有影片都能剪，片段長度還有比例限制；兩分鐘的影片，到底能擷取多長？這篇整理使用條件與操作方式。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-10T12:37:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfj7C8_FFZa","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dfj7C8_FFZa","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-10T12:37:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfjog_hlNd2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dfjog_hlNd2","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"轉：乾，好有道理","timestamp":"2026-11-10T09:55:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":10,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfjmhyOFLqx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfjmhyOFLqx","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"AI 代理除了寫程式，還能幫你做什麼？AgentUseCases.ai 整理逾 2,000 筆使用案例，可按工具找靈感，還附提示詞與原始來源。不過，使用者分享不等於逐項實測保證，怎麼挑出值得試的用法？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-10T09:38:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfjmw1qFGAj","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dfjmw1qFGAj","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-10T09:40:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfjR4G4lOEZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfjR4G4lOEZ","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-10T06:37:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfjR3otFHC3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfjR3otFHC3","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"OpenAI 把 Codex 遊戲開發接上復古掌機！用外掛設計關卡、製作精靈動畫，再到 Chromatic 測試作品。從電腦開發到實體卡帶，還有哪些準備與限制？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-10T06:37:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfkL9HTj70d","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfkL9HTj70d","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Fable 5.2 做影片又更精緻了\n\n之前用 Opus 做過類似的 Ikea 家具教學動畫\n效果已經很不錯\n這次用 Fable 全程建模跟製作動畫影片\n\n組裝家具苦手黨現在可以照著影片無腦安裝\n\n平常會需要附上說明書的商家們\n也能好好思考自己的產品是否也能讓 AI 來幫忙","timestamp":"2026-11-10T15:07:49.000Z","stats":{"likes":15,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":17,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T05:12:55+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfjC2P7k7pv","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfjC2P7k7pv","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"新的 Claude Fable 重置券規則有點複雜\n和以往的重置券很不一樣！\n用已知的資料整理一下：\n\n1. 大家拿到的數量不一樣\n→ Pro、Team Standard：1 張\nMax、Ultra、Team Premium 看訂閱多久\n→  未滿 6 個月 1 張\n→  6 到 12 個月 2 張\n→  超過 12 個月 3 張\n\n2. 期限\n台北時間 2027/3/9 下午 3:59 前要用完\n\n3. Fable 重置券怎麼重置？\n→  5 小時額度整條補滿\n→  每週額度只退回 Fable 用掉的那一份\n其他模型用掉的，不會一起 reset\n\n建議不要太急著用掉！\nweekly limit 到底怎麼補、有沒有災情\n可以等更多使用心得出來後再評估怎麼用","timestamp":"2026-11-10T04:26:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":196,"replies":29,"reposts":11,"shares":202},"score":287,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfhYW_OH8o_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfhYW_OH8o_","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"我的 reset 勒！\n\nGrok Bot 近期傳出使用量劇增的情況\n雖然沒有明顯感受到\n\nLine 群組裡面朋友們把它玩的咪咪冒冒也還夠\n但發 reset 就是讚，有用的朋友們可以看看是否收到了","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:55:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":10,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":20,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Dfe_a1BH9tN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfe_a1BH9tN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"圖文版上架囉！","timestamp":"2026-11-08T14:39:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DfeH9LAG9Cx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfeH9LAG9Cx","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"iPhone手機複製，Mac 直接貼上。\n中間不用傳給Line了！！\n​\n這個功能叫「通用剪貼板」，\n跟 AirDrop 一樣是蘋果內建的互通功能，\n文字、圖片都能直接過去。\n​\n◼︎ 設定兩步\n① iPhone：設定 → 一般 → AirPlay 與接續互動 → 打開 Handoff\n② Mac：系統設定 → 一般 → AirDrop 與接續互動 → 打開接續互動\n​\n◼︎ 記得\n✅ 兩台登入同一個 Apple ID\n✅ 藍牙、Wi-Fi 都要開","timestamp":"2026-11-08T06:34:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":117,"replies":15,"reposts":15,"shares":237},"score":192,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfgiXgflA-H","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfgiXgflA-H","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"但如果需要多則常用訊息存成快捷！可以使用CopyNow的快捷卡片+鍵盤⌨️\n更方便管理！\napps.apple.com/us/ap…","timestamp":"2026-11-09T05:03:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-11T01:36:02+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}